{
  "summary": "This experiment tested the scvi_n200 RNA encoder in a singleprofile RNA-only setup without aggregation or fusion, comparing its performance to previous RNA-only baselines. Validation accuracy (0.5203) and F1 (0.4982) are higher than the singleprofile pca_n2000 baseline (0.4849 and 0.4639), suggesting the encoder may contribute to performance. However, uncertainty remains about whether multiprofile benefits or other factors like aggregation/fusion could further improve results."
}

